## Kernel Modules

|  #  | Module                        | Type         | Description                                            | Difficulty | Status  |
| :-: | :---------------------------- | :----------- | :----------------------------------------------------- | :--------: | :-----: |
|  1  | `getppid`                     | System Call  | Returns the parent process's ID                        |    Easy    | Pending |
|  2  | `trace`                       | System Call  | Prints each system call a process makes                |   Medium   | Pending |
|  3  | `sysinfo`                     | System Call  | Reports free memory and number of running processes    |   Medium   | Pending |
|  4  | `freemem`                     | System Call  | Returns the number of free memory pages                |    Easy    | Pending |
|  5  | `getprocsize`                 | System Call  | Returns the memory size of the calling process         |    Easy    | Pending |
|  6  | `setpriority` / `getpriority` | System Call  | Sets and reads a process's priority                    |   Medium   | Pending |
|  7  | `syscount`                    | Kernel/User  | Counts how many times each system call is made         |   Medium   | Pending |
|  8  | `ps`                          | User Program | Lists running processes with PID, state, size and name |   Medium   | Pending |
|  9  | `uptime`                      | User Program | Shows how long the system has been running             |    Easy    | Pending |
| 10  | Boot Banner                   | Kernel       | Shows project and team info when xv6 boots             |    Easy    | Pending |
